      "Phrase": "现在虽然被称作超演剧时代，戏剧确实很流行。/n当演员也算是一种身份象征，大家都喜欢看舞台。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可其中最高峰的……World Dai Star，/n听说只有极少数人能成为吧。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "与其去追求那种东西，能赚钱的工作多得是。/n有空做没用的事，不如多学习，对自己更有好处。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "既然你这么想，那就试试看？/n我可以让你去上戏剧课程。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真的！？",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯。妈妈他们工作很忙，/n总不能每天放学后都陪着你。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020402036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020402,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过，只到你上初中为止。/n如果到那时还没成为Dai Star，就必须放弃演戏。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10204020340",
